    },
    {
      "id": "JZmsMk9SBny0VENhPPdT9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2944.9523958090754,
      "y": -2632.649314585554,
      "width": 557.1650667813137,
      "height": 750.8813366058334,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 588447485,
      "version": 977,
      "versionNonce": 1375563578,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745152623104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n\n1. Car pool service\n2. Request matching\n    I. Customers put a request\n        a. source\n        b. destination\n        II. Drivers would be shown\nthe request\n4. Only one driver should accept a\nrequest\n5. User cancel the booking\n\nOptional:\n1. Notifications\n2. Payment\n3. Driver management \n4. Auth\n5. User management",
      "fontSize": 31.616056278140356,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n\n1. Car pool service\n2. Request matching\n    I. Customers put a request\n        a. source\n        b. destination\n        II. Drivers would be shown the request\n4. Only one driver should accept a request\n5. User cancel the booking\n\nOptional:\n1. Notifications\n2. Payment\n3. Driver management \n4. Auth\n5. User management",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5C1gy-rdsAj_PxDIsg14r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2939.221418065139,
      "y": -1754.853697794195,
      "width": 476.7412689241456,
      "height": 237.12042208605268,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1217110077,
      "version": 352,
      "versionNonce": 1276438054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745152323418,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non functional Requirement:\n\n1. High availability\n2. Consistency\n3. Scalable\n4. Performant -> Low latency",
      "fontSize": 31.616056278140356,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non functional Requirement:\n\n1. High availability\n2. Consistency\n3. Scalable\n4. Performant -> Low latency",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TIWBh52GFUx5kMNDCahl7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3987.0231339651914,
      "y": -2660.3886837618975,
      "width": 548.7620884314697,
      "height": 1383.202462168641,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1218166941,
      "version": 887,
      "versionNonce": 1334370426,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745152873231,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Back of the envelope calc:\n\n1. API \n100M DAU\n\nwrites:\n200M requests -> user\n200M accepts -> drivers\n\nwrites -> 400M/86400 -> 4k rps\n4k * 5 -> 20k rps\n\nreads:\n1 : 10 -> 200k rps \n\nRead heavy system because of\nupdates - ride location, driver\nlocation, rider location\n\n2. Storage\n\nDriver\ni. driverId\nii. currentLocation\nUser\nTrip\n\n100 B * 100M users -> 1GB\n100 B * 200M requests -> 2GB\n100 B * 1M drivers -> 100MB\n100 B * 200M -> 2GB\n\n10 years \n~ 10GB * 365 * 10 ~ 30 TB\n",
      "fontSize": 31.616056278140363,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Back of the envelope calc:\n\n1. API \n100M DAU\n\nwrites:\n200M requests -> user\n200M accepts -> drivers\n\nwrites -> 400M/86400 -> 4k rps\n4k * 5 -> 20k rps\n\nreads:\n1 : 10 -> 200k rps \n\nRead heavy system because of updates - ride location, driver location, rider location\n\n2. Storage\n\nDriver\ni. driverId\nii. currentLocation\nUser\nTrip\n\n100 B * 100M users -> 1GB\n100 B * 200M requests -> 2GB\n100 B * 1M drivers -> 100MB\n100 B * 200M -> 2GB\n\n10 years \n~ 10GB * 365 * 10 ~ 30 TB\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mMOLJ1zj8pTLvwYFkt5nI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8962.971521209409,
      "y": -123.01596064787623,
      "width": 458.12773675515655,
      "height": 850,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1317499261,
      "version": 732,
      "versionNonce": 657815846,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745152327467,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DB Schema:\n\ni. User\nuserId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\nii. Driver\ndriverId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\niii. Vehicle\nvehicleId: UUID\ndriverId: UUID\nregistNo\nmodelNo\n\niv. Trip\ntripId: UUID\nsource\ndestination\nuserId\ndriverId\ntripStatus: TripStatus (Requested,\nSTARTED, COMPLETED, IN_PROGRESS,\nCANCELLED)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DB Schema:\n\ni. User\nuserId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\nii. Driver\ndriverId: UUID\nname: varchar(100)\ndob: timestamp\ncreatedAt: timestamp\nupdadatedAt: timestamp\nisActive: boolean\n\niii. Vehicle\nvehicleId: UUID\ndriverId: UUID\nregistNo\nmodelNo\n\niv. Trip\ntripId: UUID\nsource\ndestination\nuserId\ndriverId\ntripStatus: TripStatus (Requested, STARTED, COMPLETED, IN_PROGRESS, CANCELLED)\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0IqunsU7ZsvTmtR7u7YAK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9685.307315441025,
      "y": -201.73135473995757,
      "width": 606.6481484704632,
      "height": 1000,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 186485651,
      "version": 1079,
      "versionNonce": 248314106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1745152349034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core APIs:\n\nUser:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/user/trip\nReq.body -> {\n    \"source\": \"lat, long\"\n    \"destination\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"currentLocation\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"requestedAt\": timestamp\n}\n\nResponse -> 201: Accepted {\n       \"message\": \"\",\n        \"tripId\": \"\",\n        \"estimatedFare\": 1000\n}\n\n2. GET /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"status\": \"started\" | \"in progress\",\n    \"driver\": {\n        \"location\": \"\",\n        \"driverId\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}/cancel\n{\n    \"status\": \"cancelled\"\n}\n\nDriver:\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/driver/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"requestType\": \"accept\" | \"reject\"\n}\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core APIs:\n\nUser:\n\n1. POST /api/v1/user/trip\nReq.body -> {\n    \"source\": \"lat, long\"\n    \"destination\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"currentLocation\": \"lat, long\",\n    \"requestedAt\": timestamp\n}\n\nResponse -> 201: Accepted {\n       \"message\": \"\",\n        \"tripId\": \"\",\n        \"estimatedFare\": 1000\n}\n\n2. GET /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"status\": \"started\" | \"in progress\",\n    \"driver\": {\n        \"location\": \"\",\n        \"driverId\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\n3. PUT /api/v1/user/trip/{tripId}/cancel\n{\n    \"status\": \"cancelled\"\n}\n\nDriver:\n\n4. PUT /api/v1/driver/trip/{tripId}\n{\n    \"requestType\": \"accept\" | \"reject\"\n}\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uK9qHIKvyXAV-nqYphsKJ",
